<title>FINLAND: Finnair H1 profit falls to FIM 233.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnair H1 profit falls to FIM 233.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end September,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before taxes			    233.5 vs 463.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.98 vs 3.88</p>
<p> Net sales					3,666.9 vs 3,621.8</p>
<p> Operating profit				 246.7 vs 467.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecasts for state-controlled airline Finnair was for a 292 million markka profit after financial items, before extraordinaries (range 152 million to 372 million).  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     453.7 vs 667.3</p>
<p> Depreciation				     207.1 vs 199.6</p>
<p> Net financial items		    charge 13.1 vs 4.7 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						 70.4 vs 145.9</p>
<p> Net profit					 162.2 vs 316.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-controlled airline is Finnair Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
